          "text": "{current}/{required} Nail",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Metal Bracket",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Look through the burned buildings in the Cradle of Tranquility for $2oa Metal Brackets and $1oa Nails and return to Johun \"Punchy\" Dillas in Hyjal.",
