    "enUS": {
      "description": "You know, they packed enough tools to get the essentials started, but there's never enough fastening material. Only so much cordage-winding my hands can take.\r\n\r\nResourcefulness is even better than being prepared.\r\n\r\nTake an empty bag to the burned-down remains of the alliance buildings around the Cradle of Tranquility southwest of here, and fill it with as many nails and brackets as you can find in the ashes.",
